        "original_id": "7534d8ea-a90e-5411-99f9-84ee07608a9c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Jin-young, Sunmi, Yubin, Yeeun, Hyerim\n- Organizations: JYP Entertainment\n- Groups: Wonder Girls\n\nFacts:\n- Wonder Girls was a South Korean girl group and band formed by producer Park Jin-young under JYP Entertainment in 2006.\n- Wonder Girls debuted in 2007.\n- Lee Sun-mi, known as Sunmi, was born on May 2, 1992, and is a South Korean singer.\n- Sunmi debuted in 2007 as a member of the South Korean girl group Wonder Girls.\n- Sunmi left Wonder Girls in January 2010 to pursue her academic career.\n- The final lineup of Wonder Girls consisted of Yubin, Yeeun, Sunmi, and Hyerim.",
